     The sspprraayy utility sends multiple RPC packets to _h_o_s_t and records how many
     of them were correctly received and how long it took.

     The options are as follows:

     --cc _c_o_u_n_t
             Send _c_o_u_n_t packets.

     --dd _d_e_l_a_y
             Pause _d_e_l_a_y microseconds between sending each packet.

     --ll _l_e_n_g_t_h
